[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17345.19, "timestamp": "04:49:05", "text": "我把它关掉了，我把它关掉了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17365.83, "timestamp": "04:49:25", "text": "没有幽灵行动。哦，不。我没有动静"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17368.548, "timestamp": "04:49:28", "text": "探测器工作正常。上面有个勾号"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17371.35, "timestamp": "04:49:31", "text": "目标。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17375.47, "timestamp": "04:49:35", "text": "我做了。我们在里面放了点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17378.31, "timestamp": "04:49:38", "text": "对，就是最上面那个。是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17381.91, "timestamp": "04:49:41", "text": "在？是的，已经开始了。它展现了很棒的呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17385.59, "timestamp": "04:49:45", "text": "红灯。红色激光。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17388.788, "timestamp": "04:49:48", "text": "嘿。对，就是这东西。是吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17390.708, "timestamp": "04:49:50", "text": "这个怎么样？我把它放在这里。我用这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17393.91, "timestamp": "04:49:53", "text": "就是那种事。不，这个不，不，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17395.27, "timestamp": "04:49:55", "text": "不。哦，等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17398.39, "timestamp": "04:49:58", "text": "就在这里。哦，不。"}]